olite</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Casual</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Greetings:</span></br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello</br>Good morning</br>Good afternoon</br>Good evening</br>How are you doing? </br> </br>  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Response</span></br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm very well, thank you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Greetings:</span></br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hi!   Hey! </br>Morning!</br>Afternoon!</br>Evening!</br>How's it going? </br> </br>  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Response</span></br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm good, thanks!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Introductions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Here's how you introduce yourself and introduce another person in English:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Hi, I'm Sally! What's your name?</span></br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I'm Peter. Nice to meet you.</span> </br> </br>  <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: <span class=\"italic\">This is Sally. She's a new student.</span></br><span class=\"strong\">Mr Edwards</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Hello Sally. It's a pleasure to meet you.</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"4\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Introduce Yourself</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ask a Person's Name</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Introduce Another Person</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span c